      "parent": "Y02",
      "ja": "温暖化ガス［ＧＨＧ］の採取，保管，隔離または廃棄",
      "en": "CAPTURE, STORAGE, SEQUESTRATION OR DISPOSAL OF GREENHOUSE GASES [GHG]",
      "count": 0,
      "ipcCode": "",
      "coreCode": "",
      "note": "",
